{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56582","headline":"注葛仙公气诀赠友人 · 逸人不顾","name":"注葛仙公气诀赠友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君今遣我注仙经，我乃爲君强释名。\n华岳峰前霞客喜，天台洞里隐人惊。\n云翔嶂外缘文就，鹤唳天边爲气成。\n奉劝仙公除自秘，莫教流俗浪相轻。\n（见《四库珍本初集》本《天台前集别编》。\n）（按：诗题下原注：「见《洞天集》。\n」《洞天集》爲五代後汉道士王贞范所纂，见《崇文总目》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"逸人不顾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}